        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468390/extras/f6ca795db09a1776bffa2809bdc47e14.avif?t=1780228716\" width=615 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I've been trying to contact someone out there, if someone can hear me, please answer me and connect to my core.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Won't you accept my call? Won't you enter a new world?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A passion project made alone with love, Wishbind is an exploration based, hand-crafted 2D platformer collect-a-thon, in which you'll explore a vast world to gather a special kind of leaf essence, while interacting with  characters and discovering many secrets throughout the locale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Note:</u></strong> If you already played the demo, you can copy your demo save file to the full game save directory to migrate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world in search of a special kind of leaf in a non-linear way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide array of available moves to overcome platforming challenges for different rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of some NPCs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unlockable colors for your character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter photo mode to take screenshots of your gameplay at almost any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every last corner of the map to find hidden secrets and easter eggs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game either in english, or spanish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animals!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468390/extras/f6ca795db09a1776bffa2809bdc47e14.avif?t=1780228716\" width=615 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I've been trying to contact someone out there, if someone can hear me, please answer me and connect to my core.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Won't you accept my call? Won't you enter a new world?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A passion project made alone with love, Wishbind is an exploration based, hand-crafted 2D platformer collect-a-thon, in which you'll explore a vast world to gather a special kind of leaf essence, while interacting with  characters and discovering many secrets throughout the locale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Note:</u></strong> If you already played the demo, you can copy your demo save file to the full game save directory to migrate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world in search of a special kind of leaf in a non-linear way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide array of available moves to overcome platforming challenges for different rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of some NPCs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unlockable colors for your character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter photo mode to take screenshots of your gameplay at almost any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every last corner of the map to find hidden secrets and easter eggs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game either in english, or spanish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animals!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "You have been summoned to another world to help someone gather a special kind of leaves. Explore the locale in search of increasingly difficult platforming challenges, while discovering the history and people of this new place.",
        "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain",
